# The 2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collar (8mm REX ID x 20mm OD, 9mm Length) as goBILDA sells it: the collar and its pinch bolt.
# Each is taken out of goBILDA's model of the whole of it (see 'motion/collar_clamping_8mmREX_model' in partcad.yaml),
# so each is where that model has it, and all of them are placed at the origin.
links:
  - part: motion/collar_clamping_8mmREX_collar
    name: collar
  - part: motion/collar_clamping_8mmREX_pinch_bolt
    name: pinch-bolt
